.TH SDE-LOCK 1 "October 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sde-lock \- request screen locking in SDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-lock
.SH DESCRIPTION
Requests a lock from mate-screensaver-command when installed. Otherwise delegates
to xdg-screensaver. SDE starts the installed MATE screen locker through an
SDE-only XDG autostart entry; this command does not start another daemon.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mate-screensaver-command (1),
.BR xdg-screensaver (1)
